      <span class="section-kicker">THEME OF THE CONFERENCE</span>
      <h2>“Emerging Trends in Vedic Mathematics and Science in the Indian Knowledge System”</h2>
      <p>The International Conference on “Emerging Trends in Vedic Mathematics and Science in the Indian Knowledge System” aims to explore the relevance of India's ancient mathematical and scientific traditions in addressing contemporary challenges.</p>
      <p>The conference will provide a platform for researchers, academicians, scientists, educators, and students to exchange innovative ideas, present research findings, and discuss interdisciplinary applications of Vedic Mathematics and the Indian Knowledge System (IKS).</p>
      <p>Emphasizing the objectives of NEP 2020, the conference seeks to promote research, innovation, curriculum development, and global collaboration while preserving and advancing India's rich intellectual heritage for sustainable scientific and educational development.</p>
